  {% when 'faq' %}
{% unless block.settings.hide_section %}
<section class="vh-faq vh-people-page" id="faq" style="{% render 'vectra-block-style', settings: block.settings %}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="vh-wrap vh-faq__grid">
    <aside class="vh-contact-card">
      <img class="vh-contact-card__icon" src="{{ img_chat }}" alt="">
      <p class="vh-contact-card__title">{{ block.settings.card_title | default: 'Still need a person?' }}</p>
      <p>{{ block.settings.card_text | default: 'If these answers do not cover what you need, talk with the team. We will help you name the gap and the next step.' }}</p>
      <a class="vh-btn vh-btn--white" href="#VectraContactModal" data-vh-contact-open>
        Talk to an expert
        <img src="{{ img_arrow }}" alt="">
      </a>
      {% render 'vectra-contact-details', variant: 'card', img_phone: img_phone, img_mail: img_mail, img_pin: img_pin %}
    </aside>
    <div class="vh-faq__right">
      <div class="vh-faq__glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="vh-accordion">
        <p class="vh-kicker">{{ block.settings.kicker | default: 'FAQ' }}</p>
        <h1 class="vh-h2">{{ block.settings.heading | default: 'Frequently asked questions' }}</h1>
        <p class="vh-lead">{{ block.settings.text | default: 'Straight answers about VECTRA, our resources, and how to get started.' }}</p>
        {% assign nested_items = people_cards | strip %}
        {% if nested_items != blank %}
          {{ nested_items }}
        {% else %}
        <div class="vh-acc is-open" data-vh-faq-item>
          <button type="button" data-vh-faq-btn>What does VECTRA help organisations improve?</button>
          <div class="vh-acc__body">VECTRA helps organisations reduce business risk, strengthen operational and supply chain resilience, improve ESG and sustainability performance, and build the evidence and capability needed to drive measurable results.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="vh-acc" data-vh-faq-item>
          <button type="button" data-vh-faq-btn>We already have consultants, platforms, and dashboards. Where does VECTRA fit?</button>
          <div class="vh-acc__body">Often the gap appears after the information already exists. VECTRA works with the systems, expertise, and partners you already have, then focuses on ownership, workflows, evidence, supplier engagement, and follow-through.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="vh-acc" data-vh-faq-item>
          <button type="button" data-vh-faq-btn>Can VECTRA work with the systems we already use?</button>
          <div class="vh-acc__body">Yes. VECTRA is platform-agnostic. We work with existing systems, data, teams, and partners, then introduce additional technology only where it solves a clear problem.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="vh-acc" data-vh-faq-item>
          <button type="button" data-vh-faq-btn>Who is VECTRA International?</button>
          <div class="vh-acc__body">VECTRA International is a business resilience and operational capability-building partner founded in 2005. We help organisations manage ESG requirements, supplier risk, and operational complexity through expert teams and practical, technology-enabled delivery.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="vh-acc" data-vh-faq-item>
          <button type="button" data-vh-faq-btn>Are VECTRA Resources free to access?</button>
          <div class="vh-acc__body">Yes. VECTRA Resources are free to explore. Some ebooks, playbooks, and events may require registration.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="vh-acc" data-vh-faq-item>
          <button type="button" data-vh-faq-btn>Where do we start if we know the problem but not the solution?</button>
          <div class="vh-acc__body">Start with the problem. Tell us what keeps recurring, stalling, or becoming difficult to prove. We'll help clarify what needs attention and the most practical way forward.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="vh-acc" data-vh-faq-item>
          <button type="button" data-vh-faq-btn>How does VECTRA measure progress?</button>
          <div class="vh-acc__body">We agree what improvement should look like at the start. Depending on the issue, that may include clearer ownership, closed actions, stronger evidence, improved capability, fewer recurring problems, or better supplier performance.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="vh-acc" data-vh-faq-item>
          <button type="button" data-vh-faq-btn>When was VECTRA International founded?</button>
          <div class="vh-acc__body">VECTRA International was founded in 2005 and has since worked with organizations across industries to strengthen governance, supplier accountability, and operational resilience.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="vh-acc" data-vh-faq-item>
          <button type="button" data-vh-faq-btn>Where does VECTRA International operate?</button>
          <div class="vh-acc__body">VECTRA International operates globally, with associates and specialist experts delivering local market context across regions including Africa, Europe, Asia, and beyond.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="vh-acc" data-vh-faq-item>
          <button type="button" data-vh-faq-btn>What are responsible business resources?</button>
          <div class="vh-acc__body">Responsible business resources are insights, guides, evidence, and expert analysis that help organizations understand ESG, supply chain, compliance, risk management, business resilience, and operational resilience issues and decide what action to take.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="vh-acc" data-vh-faq-item>
          <button type="button" data-vh-faq-btn>How do I find the right resource for my question?</button>
          <div class="vh-acc__body">Use the search bar on the Resources page to find material by topic, regulation, risk, or keyword. You can also browse by format if you already know whether you need a quick Insight, a deeper guide, an expert conversation, or a real-world Case Study.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="vh-acc" data-vh-faq-item>
          <button type="button" data-vh-faq-btn>How do I apply for a career or internship?</button>
          <div class="vh-acc__body">Open roles are listed on the Careers page. For internships, email <a href="mailto:info@vectra-intl.com?subject=Internship%20Opportunities">info@vectra-intl.com</a> with the subject Internship Opportunities. To join as a consultant, use the subject Become a Consultant.</div>
        </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endunless %}

{% endcase %}
